    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 7,
        "sourceEnd": 38,
        "text": "Tell me about your study, Maya.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "bdaf56d804bcf5916d14b015ceb61171ec9cb9cb0f58bcabebc2b3ecfd564371",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 45,
        "sourceEnd": 275,
        "text": "We want to know whether clearer instructions help people put a flat-pack box together. We made two instruction sheets. One has paragraphs, and the other has numbered drawings. We will give everyone the same set of cardboard parts.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "7d09fb09f05dcc84f579644773c0529bbf6743d9d1066cf318bd60f150ffcfc0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 283,
        "sourceEnd": 322,
        "text": "Good. How will you divide participants?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "54dabafa761ab2b234ff0db5e9368443cea12add49b3fea88d7a83eed1dadfc3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 329,
        "sourceEnd": 382,
        "text": "We thought people could choose the sheet they prefer.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "2efed411085bf92d5d9580f1a753413f9548da456aa4d114fe71c3e2849c7613",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 390,
        "sourceEnd": 622,
        "text": "That would make the result difficult to interpret. People who choose drawings might already be better at this kind of task. Allocate the sheets at random instead. Record whether participants have assembled similar boxes before, too.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "83266363dfd976eb635db83d4bc5e87b305465da6c24c95b4c70e317371c9945",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 629,
        "sourceEnd": 668,
        "text": "Should we time how quickly they finish?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9837545075fc09de9cca3597b7cc7939036db6793e34884bc65046a1727c6bb1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 676,
        "sourceEnd": 897,
        "text": "Yes, but speed alone is not enough. A box assembled quickly may fall apart. Check whether each finished box can hold a standard weight. Use the same weight for everyone, and decide the checking procedure before you start.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "24404d7ea124412f8eaf4ca0d535b7a67e5ddf85556d7983a395dae1ab3678e3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 904,
        "sourceEnd": 1056,
        "text": "We have twenty-four volunteers. Half can come on Monday and half on Wednesday. Could we use the paragraph sheet on Monday and the drawings on Wednesday?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "40b27b74110feaa6e18f9d07b89cfbeb7d66105b774f50a86e4ed885b66725b1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1064,
        "sourceEnd": 1239,
        "text": "Avoid that. A difference between days could become a difference between instruction types. Use both types on each day. Keep the room arrangement and the time allowed the same.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c5b5c89472d996312dbab4fe8ddc3f1262f8ab650dfe428eccedc29439463af1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1246,
        "sourceEnd": 1288,
        "text": "What about helping someone who gets stuck?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "3a6e774b5c26deb36d3e74eb718ea9ec99fadbc189c984a607e65da7d12be539",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1296,
        "sourceEnd": 1537,
        "text": "Explain the safety rules to everyone beforehand, but do not give extra assembly hints during the independent task. If someone decides to stop, record that choice. Do not invent a finishing time for them or delete them because they were slow.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "d8b2bb5f2583d53914432ae7758b3685d4fe8125e98dbfbe0e7b4b09b7a93883",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1544,
        "sourceEnd": 1584,
        "text": "We will also ask which sheet they liked.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9244e40864a27968227176c7fa87608874c2f146d39e2a756c414f518b46d228",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1592,
        "sourceEnd": 1875,
        "text": "That can be useful, as long as you report preference separately from successful assembly. A person might enjoy a sheet that does not help them make a stronger box. With a small volunteer sample, treat the project as an initial comparison rather than a conclusion about all consumers.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "7fdb408270d9c8cfccc675a503d9064199b796e3c1147d0eef420f19bb9507e0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
